#: src/ui/charging.rs:155
msgid ""
"Lithium batteries wear faster when kept at full charge. If your laptop is "
"plugged in most of the time, limiting the charge to about 80% can noticeably "
"extend the battery's lifespan."
msgstr ""
"Lithium-Akkus altern schneller, wenn sie dauerhaft voll geladen sind. Wenn "
"dein Laptop meistens am Netz hängt, kann ein Ladelimit von etwa 80 % die "
"Lebensdauer des Akkus spürbar verlängern."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:158
msgid "Current Setting"
msgstr "Aktuelle Einstellung"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:16
msgid "Run on Battery"
msgstr "Akku verwenden"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:162
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:168
msgid "Limit Maximum Charge"
msgstr "Maximale Ladung begrenzen"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:170
msgid "Stop Charging At"
msgstr "Laden stoppen bei"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:171 src/ui/power.rs:190 src/ui/preferences.rs:53
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Prozent"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:175
msgid "Resume Charging Below"
msgstr "Laden fortsetzen unter"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:176
msgid "Avoids topping up after every small drop"
msgstr "Vermeidet Nachladen nach jedem kleinen Abfall"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:180
msgid "Keep After Restart"
msgstr "Nach Neustart beibehalten"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:181
msgid "Re-apply the limit at startup and after waking from sleep"
msgstr "Wendet das Limit beim Start und nach dem Aufwachen wieder an"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:185
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Anwenden"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:201
msgid "Charging Schedule"
msgstr "Ladeplan"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:202
msgid ""
"Charge to 100% just before you need the laptop, and keep your limit the rest "
"of the time. This needs a saved charge limit: turn on Limit Maximum Charge "
"and Keep After Restart, then Apply."
msgstr ""
"Lade kurz bevor du den Laptop brauchst auf 100 % und behalte sonst dein "
"Limit. Dafür ist ein gespeichertes Ladelimit nötig: Schalte „Maximale Ladung "
"begrenzen“ und „Nach Neustart beibehalten“ ein und wähle dann Anwenden."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:205
msgid "Optimized Charging"
msgstr "Optimiertes Laden"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:206
msgid "Learns when you usually unplug and charges to 100% just before"
msgstr ""
"Lernt, wann du den Laptop meist abziehst, und lädt kurz davor auf 100 %"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:208
msgid "Learned So Far"
msgstr "Bisher gelernt"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:211
msgid "Start Charging Before"
msgstr "Laden beginnen vor"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:212
